@PizzaOrderDesigner.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5158

### Health (API + database)
GET {{PizzaOrderDesigner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Menu: sizes, topping categories, per-size topping prices
GET {{PizzaOrderDesigner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/menu
Accept: application/json

### Quote: the API contract's worked example → total 31.23
POST {{PizzaOrderDesigner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [ { "sizeCode": "large", "toppingCodes": ["pepperoni", "bacon"], "quantity": 2 } ],
  "promoCode": "ILOVEPIZZA",
  "tip": { "mode": "percent", "value": "15" }
}

### Quote: SAVE5 on an order that isn't over $20 → 400 with a field error
POST {{PizzaOrderDesigner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [ { "sizeCode": "small", "toppingCodes": [], "quantity": 2 } ],
  "promoCode": "SAVE5",
  "tip": { "mode": "amount", "value": "2.50" }
}

### OpenAPI document (Development)
GET {{PizzaOrderDesigner.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
